      "description": "Welcome to the official Primark app (and for our friends in the Republic of Ireland - Penneys!).\n\nExplore our latest collections, plan your next shopping trip, and stay on trend with affordable fashion, beauty, and lifestyle essentials – all in the palm of your hand. With daily new arrivals and collections for women, men, kids and more, you can browse everything from cosy pyjamas to stylish homeware, and check what’s in stock at your local store before you go. It’s Primark – in your pocket!  \n\nExplore the latest fashion must-haves, from seasonal trends to everyday staples, there’s something for everyone at Primark.\n\n- Shop the latest womenswear, menswear, and kidswear collections – from summer-ready outfits to cosy winter layers.  \n- Get comfy with our wide range of pyjamas, underwear, and loungewear. \n- Browse stylish and supportive maternity clothing and adorable baby essentials for your new arrival.  \n- Discover our innovative collections such as inclusive, practical adaptive clothing – combining style and ease for all abilities and our menopause collection, created with breathable, cooling fabrics for comfort and confidence. \n\nBeauty you’ll love  \nDiscover viral makeup favourites, skincare saviours, and Primark Beauty must-haves. Plan your next in-store beauty haul and stay ahead of the trends. \n\nTravel in style \nHeading off on a trip? We’ve got the luggage and travel accessories you need. Choose from hard-shell and soft-shell suitcases, cabin-size luggage, backpacks, and weekender bags.  \n\nRefresh your home \nAffordable homeware to suit every style – from soft furnishings to bold statement décor. Perfect for students, rented spaces, or quick room updates. \n\nComplete the look  \nFinish your outfit with our accessories and footwear range. Shop affordable sandals, trainers, boots, and more for women, men and kids. \n\nApp features you’ll love:\n\nSave your favourites  \nTap the heart icon next to items you adore to save your favourites and create your dream shopping list. \n\nStock checker  \nFound something you love? Use our stock checker to see if it's available in your preferred size and colour at a nearby store.  \n\nClick & Collect \nAvailable in all Primark stores across Great Britain only. Shop a wide range of clothing and homeware for the whole family on our app, then collect your items in-store at your convenience.  \n\nStore finder  \nQuickly locate your nearest store and check opening hours, directions and facilities on-the-go.  \n\nStay in the know  \nTurn on notifications to get updates on new arrivals, the latest collections, viral must-haves and more – be the first to know what’s trending at Primark.  \n\nDownload today\nThe Primark app brings everything you love about shopping in-store to your phone – from browsing the latest affordable fashion to saving your favourites and checking availability with our stock checker. Whether you're updating your wardrobe, prepping for a holiday, shopping for school essentials, or refreshing your home, we’ve got you covered. \n \nDownload the app today – and enjoy affordable style at your fingertips. ",
